  "body": "### Describe the bug\n\nHello all,\n\nI cannot integrade OMV to Homarr.\n\nI run homarr on a raspberry pi 4 model b 1GB rasbi os lite 64bit ram with docker, docker compose and portainer, the OMV runs on raspberry pi 5 with some containers running. Everything is updated to the latest version\n\nI am trying to integrade the OMV to homarr but it says that I am succesfull but the widgets aren't working at all.\n\nAfter some investigation with the help of AI, I found that some values of the CPU(Cores,etc) the OMV is sending are null and homarr disregards it and in not showing anything. I have installed the CPU temp and everything is working as expected from there.\n\nHere are the logs I get:\n2025-09-30T10:45:45.464Z error: Failed to run integration job integration=d8cxtitfotcztacnhuiz1lmc inputHash='W3t9XQ==' \n    at /app/apps/tasks/tasks.cjs:717644:11\n    at process.processTicksAndRejections (node:internal/process/task_queues:105:5)\n    at async catchingCallbackAsync (/app/apps/tasks/tasks.cjs:676862:9)\ncaused by Error: An unknown error occured while executing Integration method integrationId=\"d8cxtitfotcztacnhuiz1lmc\" integrationName=\"OpenMediaVault\" integrationUrl=\"http://192.168.69.10\"\n    at handleError2 (/app/apps/tasks/tasks.cjs:677814:23)\n    at /app/apps/tasks/tasks.cjs:677820:21\n    at process.processTicksAndRejections (node:internal/process/task_queues:105:5)\n    at async Object.requestAsync (/app/apps/tasks/tasks.cjs:717761:12)\n    at async Object.requestAsync (/app/apps/tasks/tasks.cjs:716098:16)\n    at async requestNewDataAsync (/app/apps/tasks/tasks.cjs:677162:26)\n    at async Object.getCachedOrUpdatedDataAsync (/app/apps/tasks/tasks.cjs:677173:20)\n    at async /app/apps/tasks/tasks.cjs:717638:9\n    at async catchingCallbackAsync (/app/apps/tasks/tasks.cjs:676862:9)\ncaused by Error: Invalid system information response \n    at _OpenMediaVaultIntegration.getSystemInfoAsync (/app/apps/tasks/tasks.cjs:690536:13)\n    at process.processTicksAndRejections (node:internal/process/task_queues:105:5)\n    at async Object.requestAsync (/app/apps/tasks/tasks.cjs:717761:12)\n    at async Object.requestAsync (/app/apps/tasks/tasks.cjs:716098:16)\n    at async requestNewDataAsync (/app/apps/tasks/tasks.cjs:677162:26)\n    at async Object.getCachedOrUpdatedDataAsync (/app/apps/tasks/tasks.cjs:677173:20)\n    at async /app/apps/tasks/tasks.cjs:717638:9\n    at async catchingCallbackAsync (/app/apps/tasks/tasks.cjs:676862:9)\n\n<img width=\"336\" height=\"347\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/842c43a7-0e91-482c-b719-907d76a77aff\" />\n\n\n\nAny suggestions?\n\nThank you\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nTry to integrade with OMV\n\n### Impact\n\nNot unusable but OMV widgets not working\n\n### Additional information\n\n_No response_\n\n### Version\n\n1.39.0\n\n### Installation method\n\nPortainer\n\n### Browser\n\nFirefox",
